---
/**
 * Cursor-following hover label — Figma nodes label-hover (1751:778) and
 * cursor-defult (1521:3350).
 *
 * Those two nodes were given together, which is the point: the label is not
 * pinned to the card, it rides alongside the cursor. Styling matches the
 * outlined pill used elsewhere — white fill, 3px stroke, 16/12 padding, 18px
 * Satoshi Bold uppercase.
 *
 * Usage is declarative and generic. Any element carrying `data-hover-label`
 * shows the pill with that value while the pointer is over it:
 *
 *   <article data-hover-label="Prints"> ... </article>
 *
 * MOUNTED AT BODY LEVEL, never inside Stage. Stage sets
 * `container-type: inline-size`, which implies `contain: layout` and makes it
 * the containing block for fixed descendants — a pill inside it would be
 * positioned against the stage rather than the viewport, and clipped by its
 * overflow.
 */
---

<span class="hover-label" data-hover-label-pill aria-hidden="true"></span>

<style>
  .hover-label {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    /* Above every in-stage layer, including the cursor trail. */
    z-index: 10000;
    pointer-events: none;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* Border inset from the padding, as on the nav pills, so the box matches
       Figma's 16/12 padding rather than inflating by the stroke. */
    padding: calc(var(--space-3) - var(--border-bold))
      calc(var(--space-4) - var(--border-bold));

    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: var(--border-bold) solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);

    /* Same token as the nav pills, so this matches the Contact button at any
       viewport rather than sitting a size larger. A hardcoded 18px looked
       oversized because --text-nav clamps down below the 1728px design width.
       The token uses cqw and this element is outside any container, so it
       resolves against the viewport — which tracks the nav pills closely
       because the stage is full-bleed. */
    font-size: var(--text-nav);
    line-height: calc(24 / 18);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-nav);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--color-ink);

    opacity: 0;
    will-change: transform, opacity;
  }
</style>
